        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 13.6.1. The Company agrees to pay the basic hourly rate for absence from assigned duties for four members on the Union Negotiating Committee on the day or days when in joint conference with management for the purpose of negotiating new contract provisions, changes, amendments, or modification to this Agreement. It is understood that the Union Negotiating Committee will not necessarily be limited to four members.",
